'''Back to School''' (お魚天国, ''Osakana Tengoku'', '''Fish Heaven''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': Worker Cat Max Up (Sm): Wallet size is increased by 10%.

'''Pre 4.7''': Slow Effect Up (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

