==Trivia==
*Back to School is a pun on the double meaning of the word ''school'': a place for education or a large group of fish.
*Back to School's Japanese namesake is "[https://youtu.be/ynCOyUufcEY Osakana Tengoku]" ("Fish Heaven"), a famous song that lists the names of different species of fish.

